---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-comida-evento" set:html={`
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero"><div><div class="crumb">Eventos / Comida</div><div class="eyebrow">Una lista que no compra comida para el triple</div><h1>¿Cuánta comida necesitás para tu evento?</h1><p class="lead">Repartimos a los invitados entre los platos y armamos una compra completa en pizzas, rolls, planchas, kilos y porciones.</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip">✓ Adultos y chicos</span><span class="chip">✓ Platos sin superponer</span><span class="chip">✓ Postre y margen</span></div></div><div class="visual"><div class="table"><div class="plate"></div><div class="pizza"></div><div class="fork"></div><div class="glass"></div></div><div class="cake">30</div><div class="note n1">Invitados reales</div><div class="note n2">Una sola lista de compras</div><i class="confetti c1"></i><i class="confetti c2"></i><i class="confetti c3"></i></div></div>
      <form class="calc" id="calculator"><div class="case-label">¿QUÉ TIPO DE EVENTO ES?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-mode="birthday">Cumpleaños en casa</button><button type="button" class="case" data-mode="cocktail">Cóctel o casamiento</button><button type="button" class="case" data-mode="kids">Cumple infantil</button><button type="button" class="case" data-mode="coffee">Coffee break</button></div>
        <div class="grid"><div class="panel"><h2 id="formTitle">Contá quiénes van</h2><p class="hint" id="formHint">Los chicos comen menos plato principal, pero cuentan igual para torta y helado.</p>
          <div class="fields"><div class="field"><label for="guests">Invitados totales</label><input class="control" id="guests" type="number" value="30" min="1"></div><div class="field"><label for="children">De ellos, chicos</label><input class="control" id="children" type="number" value="0" min="0"></div><div class="field"><label for="hours">Duración (horas)</label><input class="control" id="hours" type="number" value="5" min=".5" step=".5"></div><div class="field"><label for="appetite">Apetito esperado</label><select class="control" id="appetite"><option value=".85">Liviano</option><option value="1" selected>Normal</option><option value="1.2">Abundante</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="dessert">Postre</label><select class="control" id="dessert"><option value="cake">Sólo torta</option><option value="ice">Torta y helado</option><option value="sweet">Torta y mesa dulce</option><option value="none">Sin postre</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="weather">Clima</label><select class="control" id="weather"><option value="1">Templado</option><option value="1.2">Calor o exterior</option><option value=".85">Frío</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="budget">Presupuesto por persona ($)</label><input class="control" id="budget" inputmode="numeric" value="12.000"></div></div>
          <button class="update" id="updateButton" type="submit">Actualizar lista</button>
        </div>
        <div class="panel result"><div class="kicker">LISTA PRINCIPAL</div><div class="big" id="resultValue">7 pizzas + 7 rolls</div><div class="sub" id="resultSub">más 1 plancha de miga y picada para 30</div><div class="badge" id="resultBadge">Los platos ya están repartidos</div><div class="tiles"><div class="tile"><small id="t1l">Torta</small><strong id="t1v">3,3 kg</strong></div><div class="tile"><small id="t2l">Picada</small><strong id="t2v">4,5 kg</strong></div><div class="tile"><small id="t3l">Presupuesto</small><strong id="t3v">$360.000</strong></div></div></div></div>
      </form>
    </div>
    <section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">La clave para no comprar de más</div><h2>Una persona, un plato principal</h2><p>La entrada y el postre pueden ser para todos. Pizza, sushi y miga se reparten: no se suman como si cada invitado comiera todo.</p></div><div class="distribution"><div class="dist-top"><div><h3 id="distTitle">Cumpleaños en casa</h3><p id="distCopy">Reparto sugerido del plato principal.</p></div><div class="dist-total" id="distTotal">30 invitados</div></div><div class="dist-bar"><div class="portion p-pizza" id="pPizza">55%</div><div class="portion p-sushi" id="pSushi">15%</div><div class="portion p-miga" id="pMiga">30%</div><div class="portion p-other" id="pOther"></div></div><div class="legend"><div class="leg"><span class="dot p-pizza"></span>Pizza<strong id="lPizza">17 personas</strong></div><div class="leg"><span class="dot p-sushi"></span>Sushi<strong id="lSushi">5 personas</strong></div><div class="leg"><span class="dot p-miga"></span>Miga<strong id="lMiga">9 personas</strong></div><div class="leg"><span class="dot p-other"></span>Canapés / break<strong id="lOther">No aplica</strong></div></div></div></div></section>
    <section><div class="wrap two"><div class="info"><div class="eyebrow">Para llevar al proveedor</div><h3>Tu lista de compras</h3><div class="rows" id="breakRows"></div></div><div class="info notice"><div class="notice-icon">◉</div><h3>La bebida se calcula aparte</h3><p>Esta lista no incluye agua, gaseosas, alcohol ni hielo. Usá la misma cantidad de invitados y duración en la calculadora de bebidas para que ambas compras sean coherentes.</p><div class="rows"><div class="row"><span>Fiambrería</span><strong>Encargar 48 h antes</strong></div><div class="row"><span>Cadena de frío</span><strong>Máximo cuidado</strong></div></div></div></div></section>
    <section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Referencias rápidas</div><h2>Las unidades que realmente te van a pedir</h2></div><div class="refs"><div class="ref"><div class="ref-icon">🍕</div><b>8 porciones</b><span>Por pizza grande</span></div><div class="ref"><div class="ref-icon">🍣</div><b>8 piezas</b><span>Por roll de sushi</span></div><div class="ref"><div class="ref-icon">🥪</div><b>24 unidades</b><span>Por plancha de miga</span></div><div class="ref"><div class="ref-icon">🎂</div><b>100 g</b><span>De torta por invitado</span></div></div></div></section>
    <div class="dark"><div class="wrap dark-grid"><div class="formula">Invitados × consumo<span>× proporción que elige cada plato</span>= compra sin duplicados<small>La picada, los canapés de recepción y el postre sí pueden calcularse para todos.</small></div><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#70d5c5">Una compra más realista</div><h2>Sumar todas las calculadoras da comida para cuatro fiestas.</h2><p>Este reparto evita contar a la misma persona como comensal completo de pizza, sushi, miga y canapés al mismo tiempo.</p><div class="checks"><div class="check"><span class="tick">✓</span><span>En infantil, cargá bien cuántos chicos hay.</span></div><div class="check"><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Si el evento reemplaza la cena, usá apetito abundante.</span></div><div class="check"><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Confirmá alergias, opciones sin TACC y cadena de frío.</span></div></div></div></div></div>
  `} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-comida-evento')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-comida-evento');

    const $=id=>root.querySelector("#"+id),fmt=(n,d=1)=>Number(n).toLocaleString("es-AR",{maximumFractionDigits:d,minimumFractionDigits:d}),money=n=>"$"+Math.round(n).toLocaleString("es-AR"),digits=v=>Number(String(v).replace(/\D/g,""))||0;let mode="birthday";
    const cfg={birthday:{title:"Cumpleaños en casa",hint:"Los chicos comen menos plato principal, pero cuentan igual para torta y helado.",share:[.55,.15,.30,0]},cocktail:{title:"Cóctel o casamiento",hint:"En una recepción de pie los canapés reemplazan gran parte del plato.",share:[0,.4,.2,.4]},kids:{title:"Cumple infantil",hint:"Separá chicos y adultos acompañantes para no sobredimensionar la comida.",share:[.6,0,.4,0]},coffee:{title:"Coffee break",hint:"La duración define cuántas piezas toma cada asistente.",share:[0,0,0,1]}};
    function set(id,v){$(id).textContent=v}function rows(a){$("breakRows").innerHTML=a.map(x=>`<div class="row"><span>${x[0]}</span><strong>${x[1]}</strong></div>`).join("")}
    function distribute(g,s){const ids=["pPizza","pSushi","pMiga","pOther"],labs=["lPizza","lSushi","lMiga","lOther"];s.forEach((v,i)=>{$(ids[i]).style.width=(v*100)+"%";set(ids[i],v?Math.round(v*100)+"%":"");set(labs[i],v?Math.round(g*v)+" personas":"No aplica")})}
    function calculate(){const guests=Math.max(1,Number($("guests").value)||1),kids=Math.min(guests,Math.max(0,Number($("children").value)||0)),adults=guests-kids,hours=Math.max(.5,Number($("hours").value)||1),app=Number($("appetite").value)||1,dessert=$("dessert").value,weather=Number($("weather").value)||1,budget=digits($("budget").value),S=cfg[mode].share;distribute(guests,S);set("distTitle",cfg[mode].title);set("distTotal",guests+" invitados");
      if(mode==="coffee"){const pp=hours<=.5?4:hours<=1?6:8,units=Math.ceil(guests*pp*app),croissants=Math.ceil(units*.4),sandwiches=Math.ceil(units*.3),cookies=Math.ceil(units*.2),cakePieces=units-croissants-sandwiches-cookies,cafe=guests*.18,jugo=guests*.25;set("resultValue",units+" piezas");set("resultSub",`${croissants} medialunas + ${sandwiches} sándwiches + ${cookies} masas`);set("resultBadge",`${fmt(pp*app,1)} piezas por asistente`);set("t1l","Café");set("t1v",fmt(cafe,1)+" L");set("t2l","Jugos y agua");set("t2v",fmt(jugo,1)+" L");set("t3l","Presupuesto");set("t3v",money(guests*budget));rows([["Medialunas y facturas",croissants],["Sándwiches mini",sandwiches],["Masas y cookies",cookies],["Porciones de budín",cakePieces],["Café",fmt(cafe,1)+" L"],["Jugos y agua",fmt(jugo,1)+" L"],["Costo estimado",money(guests*budget)]]);return}
      const adultEq=adults+kids*.65,pizzaPeople=adultEq*S[0],sushiPeople=adultEq*S[1],migaPeople=adultEq*S[2],pizzas=Math.ceil(pizzaPeople*3.3*app/8),sushiPieces=Math.ceil(sushiPeople*12.1*app),rolls=Math.ceil(sushiPieces/8),miga=Math.ceil(migaPeople*3*app),plans=Math.ceil(miga/24),canapes=Math.ceil(guests*S[3]*(mode==="cocktail"?10:6)*(hours>2?1.15:1)*app);
      const picadaPeople=mode==="birthday"?adults:mode==="kids"?adults*.3:0,fiambre=picadaPeople*.09*app,cheese=picadaPeople*.06*app,torta=dessert==="none"?0:guests*(mode==="kids"?.08:.1)*1.1,ice=dessert==="ice"?guests*.18*weather*(kids?1.1:1):0,bombons=dessert==="sweet"?guests*2:0;
      const main=[pizzas?`${pizzas} pizzas`:"",rolls?`${rolls} rolls`:"",plans?`${plans} plancha${plans===1?"":"s"} de miga`:"",canapes?`${canapes} canapés`:""].filter(Boolean);set("resultValue",main.slice(0,2).join(" + "));set("resultSub",main.slice(2).join(" + ")||`comida principal para ${guests}`);set("resultBadge","Los platos ya están repartidos");set("t1l","Torta");set("t1v",torta?fmt(torta,1)+" kg":"Sin torta");set("t2l",ice?"Helado":bombons?"Mesa dulce":"Picada");set("t2v",ice?fmt(ice,1)+" L":bombons?Math.ceil(bombons)+" bombones":fmt(fiambre+cheese,1)+" kg");set("t3l","Presupuesto");set("t3v",money(guests*budget));
      const list=[];if(pizzas)list.push(["Pizzas grandes de 8 porciones",pizzas]);if(rolls)list.push(["Sushi",`${sushiPieces} piezas · ${rolls} rolls`]);if(plans)list.push(["Sándwiches de miga",`${miga} unidades · ${plans} planchas`]);if(canapes)list.push(["Canapés",canapes]);if(fiambre+cheese>0){list.push(["Fiambre",fmt(fiambre,1)+" kg"],["Queso",fmt(cheese,1)+" kg"])}if(torta)list.push(["Torta",fmt(torta,1)+" kg"]);if(ice)list.push(["Helado",fmt(ice,1)+" L"]);if(bombons)list.push(["Bombones",Math.ceil(bombons)]);list.push(["Costo estimado",money(guests*budget)]);rows(list)}
    root.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{mode=b.dataset.mode;root.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x===b));set("formTitle",cfg[mode].title);set("formHint",cfg[mode].hint);calculate()}));root.querySelectorAll("input[type=number],select").forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",calculate));$("budget").addEventListener("input",e=>{const n=digits(e.target.value);e.target.value=n?n.toLocaleString("es-AR"):"";calculate()});function confirm(){calculate();$("updateButton").textContent="✓ Lista actualizada";clearTimeout(window.foodTimer);window.foodTimer=setTimeout(()=>$("updateButton").textContent="Actualizar lista",1200)}$("calculator").addEventListener("submit",e=>{e.preventDefault();confirm()});$("updateButton").addEventListener("click",e=>{e.preventDefault();confirm()});calculate();
  
})();
</script>
<style is:global>

    .mockup-comida-evento{--ink:#111a32;--muted:#667187;--blue:#2168e8;--coral:#f27b68;--teal:#25b3a0;--amber:#f1ad49;--paper:#f7f6f1;--line:#dfe4ea;--navy:#174B7A}
    .mockup-comida-evento *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-comida-evento{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.45 Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}.mockup-comida-evento button,.mockup-comida-evento input,.mockup-comida-evento select{font:inherit}.mockup-comida-evento .wrap{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
    .mockup-comida-evento header{height:86px;border-bottom:1px solid #e1e4e7;display:flex;align-items:center}.mockup-comida-evento .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px}.mockup-comida-evento .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:19px;font-weight:900}.mockup-comida-evento .logo{width:29px;height:38px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#18355c,#527a99);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white}.mockup-comida-evento .links{display:flex;gap:25px;color:#505b6d;font-size:14px;font-weight:750}.mockup-comida-evento .tools{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:9px}.mockup-comida-evento .tool{height:42px;padding:0 14px;border:1px solid #dce1e7;background:white;border-radius:11px;color:#526075;font-weight:750}
    .mockup-comida-evento .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:45px;align-items:center;padding:62px 0 45px}.mockup-comida-evento .crumb{color:#3167c4;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:17px}.mockup-comida-evento .eyebrow{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#2374b7;font-weight:900}.mockup-comida-evento h1{font-size:clamp(43px,5vw,67px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:13px 0 20px}.mockup-comida-evento .lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:690px}.mockup-comida-evento .chips{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:25px}.mockup-comida-evento .chip{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;padding:9px 13px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
    .mockup-comida-evento .visual{height:330px;position:relative}.mockup-comida-evento .table{position:absolute;left:34px;top:80px;width:310px;height:190px;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 26px 55px #24385320}.mockup-comida-evento .plate{position:absolute;left:89px;top:32px;width:130px;height:130px;border:17px solid #e7edf3;border-radius:50%;background:#fff}.mockup-comida-evento .pizza{position:absolute;left:111px;top:54px;width:88px;height:88px;background:#f2b34d;border-radius:50%;clip-path:polygon(50% 50%,100% 15%,100% 100%,0 100%,0 15%)}.mockup-comida-evento .pizza:after{content:"●  ●  ●";position:absolute;color:#e06655;left:18px;top:30px;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:4px}.mockup-comida-evento .fork{position:absolute;left:42px;top:28px;width:8px;height:134px;background:#17385f;border-radius:5px}.mockup-comida-evento .glass{position:absolute;right:30px;top:13px;width:55px;height:95px;border:7px solid #17385f;border-radius:6px 6px 24px 24px;background:linear-gradient(transparent 42%,#69cddb 43%)}.mockup-comida-evento .cake{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:5px;width:122px;height:91px;background:#f18a7b;border:7px solid #17385f;border-radius:9px 9px 18px 18px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-size:24px;font-weight:950}.mockup-comida-evento .note{position:absolute;background:#fff;border-radius:13px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;box-shadow:0 15px 34px #17385f1d}.mockup-comida-evento .n1{left:0;top:18px}.mockup-comida-evento .n2{left:8px;bottom:3px;color:#1762d4}.mockup-comida-evento .confetti{position:absolute;width:12px;height:29px;border-radius:5px;transform:rotate(28deg)}.mockup-comida-evento .c1{right:20px;top:10px;background:#28b6a4}.mockup-comida-evento .c2{right:76px;top:48px;background:#f0ac48}.mockup-comida-evento .c3{left:8px;top:92px;background:#735de3}
    .mockup-comida-evento .calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 26px 70px #26354e13;margin-bottom:65px}.mockup-comida-evento .case-label{font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#5b677a;margin-bottom:11px}.mockup-comida-evento .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:9px;margin-bottom:25px}.mockup-comida-evento .case{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#fafbfc;padding:14px 9px;font-weight:850;color:#505d70;cursor:pointer}.mockup-comida-evento .case.active{background:#edf4ff;color:#1c60d2;border-color:#246be7;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #246be7}.mockup-comida-evento .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.04fr .96fr;gap:23px}.mockup-comida-evento .panel{background:#fafbfc;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:20px;padding:24px}.mockup-comida-evento .panel h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 5px}.mockup-comida-evento .hint{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 20px}.mockup-comida-evento .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.mockup-comida-evento .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-comida-evento .field label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-comida-evento .control{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #cad3dd;border-radius:11px;background:#fff;padding:0 13px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:750;outline:none}.mockup-comida-evento .control:focus{border-color:#286fe8;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #286fe818}.mockup-comida-evento .update{width:100%;height:53px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue);color:white;font-weight:900;margin-top:20px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 10px 22px #1e67e82c}
    .mockup-comida-evento .result{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#102c55,#0b1c38);border:0;color:white;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.mockup-comida-evento .result:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:215px;height:215px;border:44px solid #f07e6921;border-radius:50%;right:-115px;bottom:-125px}.mockup-comida-evento .kicker{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#ffc2b7;font-weight:900}.mockup-comida-evento .big{font-size:39px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:14px 0 5px}.mockup-comida-evento .sub{color:#c3d2e4}.mockup-comida-evento .badge{display:inline-flex;margin-top:17px;padding:8px 11px;border-radius:99px;background:#1e4777;border:1px solid #3d6591;font-size:12px;font-weight:850}.mockup-comida-evento .tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:24px}.mockup-comida-evento .tile{background:#ffffff0c;border:1px solid #ffffff18;border-radius:12px;padding:12px}.mockup-comida-evento .tile small{display:block;color:#adc0d6;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em}.mockup-comida-evento .tile strong{display:block;margin-top:5px;font-size:15px}
    .mockup-comida-evento section{padding:52px 0}.mockup-comida-evento .section-head{text-align:center;max-width:750px;margin:0 auto 30px}.mockup-comida-evento .section-head h2{font-size:39px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 10px}.mockup-comida-evento .section-head p{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-comida-evento .distribution{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:23px;padding:28px}.mockup-comida-evento .dist-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end}.mockup-comida-evento .dist-top h3{font-size:23px;margin:0}.mockup-comida-evento .dist-top p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-comida-evento .dist-total{font-weight:950;color:#2469d7}.mockup-comida-evento .dist-bar{display:flex;height:34px;border-radius:11px;overflow:hidden;margin:28px 0 17px}.mockup-comida-evento .portion{height:100%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;transition:width .25s}.mockup-comida-evento .p-pizza{background:#ee7865}.mockup-comida-evento .p-sushi{background:#725de2}.mockup-comida-evento .p-miga{background:#26af9d}.mockup-comida-evento .p-other{background:#f0ad48}.mockup-comida-evento .legend{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}.mockup-comida-evento .leg{font-size:12px;color:#687489}.mockup-comida-evento .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block;margin-right:6px}.mockup-comida-evento .leg strong{display:block;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);margin-top:3px}
    .mockup-comida-evento .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:22px}.mockup-comida-evento .info{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:25px}.mockup-comida-evento .info h3{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 17px}.mockup-comida-evento .rows{display:grid;gap:12px}.mockup-comida-evento .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f3}.mockup-comida-evento .row:last-child{padding:0;border:0}.mockup-comida-evento .row span{color:#657186}.mockup-comida-evento .row strong{text-align:right}.mockup-comida-evento .notice{background:#fff6e8;border-color:#f1d2a0}.mockup-comida-evento .notice p{color:#725934}.mockup-comida-evento .notice-icon{font-size:28px}.mockup-comida-evento .refs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}.mockup-comida-evento .ref{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:19px;padding:20px}.mockup-comida-evento .ref-icon{font-size:27px}.mockup-comida-evento .ref b{display:block;font-size:23px;margin:10px 0 3px}.mockup-comida-evento .ref span{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
